+++ b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-09-fix-coupon-giveback-and-free-shipping/specs/coupons/spec.md
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Cancelling an order gives back its single-use coupon
+A single-use coupon SHALL be usable again once the order that used it is cancelled, and SHALL stay used while
+that order is not cancelled.
+
+#### Scenario: Cancel then reorder with the same coupon
+- **WHEN** order ORD-0001 is placed on 2026-03-02 with single-use coupon WELCOME and cancelled on 2026-03-02, then a new order is placed on 2026-03-02 with WELCOME
+- **THEN** the new order is accepted with the coupon applied
+
+#### Scenario: Cancelled on day 14
+- **WHEN** an order with a single-use coupon is placed on 2026-03-02 and cancelled on 2026-03-16
+- **THEN** the coupon can be used by a new order
+
+#### Scenario: Coupon still used without cancellation
+- **WHEN** order ORD-0001 used single-use coupon WELCOME and is not cancelled
+- **THEN** another order with WELCOME is refused as already used
+
+#### Scenario: Another customer's cancellation does not free it
+- **WHEN** ORD-0002 (a different order) is cancelled while ORD-0001 holds WELCOME
+- **THEN** WELCOME stays used by ORD-0001
