+++ b/openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-09-fix-coupon-giveback-and-free-shipping/specs/shipping/spec.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Free-shipping threshold looks at goods after discounts
+The 5000-cent threshold SHALL be compared with the goods amount after every discount, not with the gross amount of the lines.
+
+#### Scenario: Gross €50.00 reduced by a coupon
+- **WHEN** the lines total 5000 cents gross and a coupon takes 500 cents off (goods 4500) and the parcel weighs 500 g
+- **THEN** shipping is 490 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Discounted goods of exactly €50.00
+- **WHEN** the lines total 5500 cents gross and a coupon takes 500 cents off (goods 5000)
+- **THEN** shipping is 0 cents
